name:           haskoin-store
version:        1.8.1
synopsis:       Storage and index for Bitcoin and Bitcoin Cash
description:    An indexer for Bitcoin and Bitcoin Cash. It downloads blocks and mempool
                transactions from the peer-to-peer network, indexes them in RocksDB, and
                serves a REST API with balances, transactions and unspent outputs of
                addresses and extended public keys, a Blockchain.info compatible API, and
                events over WebSockets. An optional Redis cache, shared by several stores,
                keeps large wallets fast. See the README for installation and
                configuration.
category:       Bitcoin, Finance, Network
homepage:       https://github.com/jprupp/haskoin-store#readme
bug-reports:    https://github.com/jprupp/haskoin-store/issues
author:         JP Rupp
maintainer:     jprupp@protonmail.ch
copyright:      (c) Haskoin Developers
license:        MIT
